  "id": "visual-texture",
  "term": "visual texture",
  "definition": "Visual texture is the texture-like quality of a visual experience, such as seeing a voice as having a smoke-like or dry, cracked appearance. In the packet, it refers to texture perceptions that can accompany sounds in voice-induced synesthesia.",
